{{Quote|A legendary katana, said to be possessed by a demon.|Item}}
'''Yama''' is a {{Legendary}} [[sword]].

Yama is good mobility-support sword in PvP, allowing the user to create powerful combos.

==Obtainment==
Yama can be obtained by completing the [[Yama/Puzzle|Yama puzzle]].

Upon equipping Yama, the user will be given the {{Title|Demon Mode}} [[title]] #162.

==Usage==
Getting both [[Tushita]] and Yama to 350 [[mastery]] and being Lv. 2200 or higher will grant the player access to do the [[Cursed Dual Katana/Puzzle|Cursed Dual Katana puzzle]] and to obtain the [[Cursed Dual Katana]] once they have completed the puzzle.

